OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'devastated' after daughter
OL,4,Atold she cannot stay on children's ward
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a teenager with a
OL,7,Flearning disability say she has been
OL,8,Ftold she cannot be cared for on a
OL,9,Fchildren's ward during a major medical
OL,10,Fprocedure, despite her assurances that
OL,11,Fshe would be.
OL,13,FRegan Kelly's parents, Karen and
OL,14,FAnthony, said they were given written
OL,15,Fconfirmation that their daughter would
OL,16,Fbe accommodated on the children's ward
OL,17,Fat Causeway Hospital, where she had
OL,18,Fspent periods of time over many years.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
