OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'devastated' after daughter
OL,4,Atold she cannot stay on children's ward
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut when they arrived for her planned
OL,7,Fstoma surgery last month, they said
OL,8,Fthey were told she would not be
OL,9,Faccommodated on the children's ward.
OL,11,FThe Northern Health Trust has
OL,12,Fapologised to Regan and her family "for
OL,13,Fthe distress, anxiety, and frustration
OL,14,Fcaused by their experience".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
